{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24694","headline":"闲居 · 白居易","name":"闲居","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"风雨萧条秋少客，门庭冷静昼多关。\n金羁骆马近卖却，罗袖柳枝寻放还。\n书卷略寻聊取睡，酒杯浅把麤开颜。\n眼昏入夜休看月，脚重经春不上山。\n心静无妨喧处寂，机忘兼觉梦中闲。\n是非爱恶销停尽，唯寄空身在世间。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24694.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24694","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}